gomodel:685de18700004836
        a                 owl:Ontology ;
        rdfs:comment      "General: Automated change 2025-08-14: GO:0010706 replaced by GO:0001574" , "Comment to reviewer: ER-to-Golgi delivery of ceramide for GlcCer synthesis is CERT-independent (PMID:14685229, PMID:18068681) and is thought to be vesicular; no mediating gene product with a defined MF has been identified in mammals, so this step is represented by the change in ceramide location from DEGS1 output to UGCG input." ;
        lego:modelstate   "review" ;
